**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.pipelines.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `name` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`ScopedMutation` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
